# Security

Full doc: `docs/standards/security.md`

- Tokens only in `lib/auth-storage.ts` + `apiRequest()` — never log or expose
- All secrets in `.env` — never `VITE_*` for secrets (client-bundled)
- Context headers from `/me` memberships only
- zod validate before every API submit
- No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` without sanitization
- UI hides unauthorized actions; handle 403 gracefully
- Portal: read-only — no mutation UI
- Run `pnpm audit` at release milestones
